{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_00e5fec803f004d0fa98cce2","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","chunk_index":15,"job_id":"mwjob_f11b0c8e6a5369e3b3df8f61","precondition_digest":"74bc4d137995a3fbc08798d185a3087639dacc8b6f5d24c66b6f3176731163ab","project_id":"proj_user_415ce4db48b2","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_1e3fce79bfe7ce0b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ca2884a55b3367a7","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_bf6f9fc8a538f1eb","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_c048cb303b228232"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"不良事件（AE）与严重不良事件（SAE）发生率（至末次给药后28天）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查异常发生率；症状性低血压发生率","quote_sha256":"eeb150d5b4105ba3f52e8fcb897d472c81b951c8a8aeebfbd7c19078cac79329","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"安全性按SAS描述；无确证性假设检验","quote_sha256":"c8873027c51772f23509884d305473c7e7ff600604e77c8fdec4ad9b0ebc6a09","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_stat_strategy"},{"locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","quote":"有效性评价、安全性评价、PK 评价、PD 评价、免疫原性评价以及其他分析将在本研究的统计分析计划（SAP）中详细规定，数据库锁定前将最终确定 SAP。","quote_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","span_id":"es_sap_safety"},{"locator":"section:7.3.7 严重不良事件一致性比对|block:1049|chunk:1","quote":"EDC 中 SAE 关键数据点应与安全性数据库进行一致性比对。","quote_sha256":"89137f59a7a4b6b574df06af2472181735de0125de055f6939636b33ffcf7e2c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","span_id":"es_sae_consistency"},{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:198|chunk:1","quote":"本研究将符合ICH E2A指导原则（临床安全性数据管理：加速报告的定义和标准）。","quote_sha256":"9908eb4a8fed928d8aa7d67e712c4e13f7bc64dc32e6e258fe166d44632170ba","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","span_id":"es_ich_e2a"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"DMC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"7463c7eb67cd6a318d836f289e02648d5296c8dfe0b2f415f8f2bed6e14be4a2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_no_dmc"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_stat_strategy","es_sap_safety","es_sae_consistency","es_ich_e2a","es_no_dmc"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目安全性管理计划或药物安全SOP，明确AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、分级、报告对象与时限","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_01","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性管理计划","药物安全SOP"],"target":"安全性数据分析章节中AE分级标准（如CTCAE版本）、因果关系判定方法、SAE报告时限及SUSAR加速报告流程"},{"action":"补充安全性信号检测与评估SOP或药物警戒计划","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_02","missing_source_classes":["安全性信号检测SOP","药物警戒计划"],"target":"安全性数据分析章节中安全性信号检测方法、阈值及触发后续行动的标准"},{"action":"由医学经理确认SAS定义并写入统计分析计划","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_safety_03","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"SAS的精确纳入标准（是否要求至少一次给药、是否包含治疗期外事件）"}],"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性管理计划（含AE分级标准、SAE/SUSAR报告时限与流程）","安全性信号检测与评估SOP","SAS定义及安全性分析详细方法学文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究的统计学分析策略以描述性安全性评价为主，不设确证性假设检验。安全性分析集（SAS）纳入至少接受一次研究药物给药的受试者，安全性数据按实际接受的治疗进行汇总。安全性终点包括：不良事件与严重不良事件的发生率（观察窗口为首次给药至末次给药后28天）；生命体征、12导联心电图及临床实验室检查的异常发生率；症状性低血压的发生率。安全性数据的收集、编码、因果关系判定及严重性分级遵循ICH E2A指导原则关于临床安全性数据管理的要求。EDC中记录的严重不良事件关键数据点应与申办方安全性数据库进行一致性比对，以确保安全性信息的完整性和准确性。安全性评价的具体分析方法、亚组分析策略及安全性信号检测规则将在统计分析计划中详细规定，统计分析计划于数据库锁定前最终确定。本研究不设置独立数据安全监查委员会，安全性信息的持续审阅由申办方药物安全部门依据既定流程执行。","rationale":"安全性终点（AE/SAE至末次给药后28天、生命体征、心电图、实验室检查、症状性低血压）、SAS描述性分析、无确证性假设检验、SAP在数据库锁定前确定、EDC与安全性数据库一致性比对、ICH E2A合规要求均有项目研究定义及公司语料直接支持。SAS具体定义（是否含至少一次给药）、AE分级标准版本、SAE报告时限、安全性信号检测阈值及流程、药物安全部门具体职责分工等项目级实施规则缺少来源，需医学经理补充确认。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_1e3fce79bfe7ce0b","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:198|chunk:1","quote":"本研究将完全按照ICH E6和我国GCP指导原则、赫尔辛基宣言、相关法律法规及伦理委员会审核意见进行，以提供并加强对个人的保护。","quote_sha256":"efd84e876c243abd91f664e7c8c77bb26a7587e642a435378598f9519e8dc904","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","span_id":"es_gcp_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选期（-28至-1天）；治疗期（第1天至第12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）","quote_sha256":"bd2c66fb1c011d6239bd55033e0b4ecc4371d8c2932778947261a7f5dff6072a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_study_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）。","quote_sha256":"dd63df4b3e66ae7ece55e746b97043dbd40d4385a8e4fccb4fbf1d3abe7c762d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"},{"locator":"section:12.2 方案偏离|block:951|chunk:1","quote":"对IRB/EC已批准的研究方案的任何偏离，研究者或其指定的人员应给予记录和解释。研究者应及时向申办者报告可能影响参与者安全性和数据完整性的任何偏离。","quote_sha256":"900d6022d161a9911ec00e87d9e7fc72badd94d6c4fce505ab37adac0ec6adc2","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","span_id":"es_deviation"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_gcp_compliance","es_study_periods","es_visit_strategy","es_deviation"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充数据管理计划，明确数据采集系统、录入时限、核查规则及数据清理策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_data_01","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划"],"target":"数据采集与管理章节中EDC系统选择、数据录入与核查流程、数据清理计划"},{"action":"补充数据管理计划或监查计划中关于SDV的具体规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_data_02","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","监查计划"],"target":"数据采集与管理章节中源数据核查（SDV）比例、范围及核查方法"},{"action":"补充数据管理计划中数据锁定流程及SAP定稿时间要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_data_03","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","统计分析计划"],"target":"数据采集与管理章节中数据锁定程序及数据库锁定前SAP最终确定的时间节点"}],"heading":"数据采集与管理","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划（含EDC系统、数据录入与核查流程、数据清理计划、源数据核查范围）","数据锁定程序"],"proposal_text":"本研究的数据采集与管理完全遵循ICH E6（GCP）指导原则、我国药物临床试验质量管理规范、赫尔辛基宣言及相关法律法规的要求，以保障受试者权益并确保数据完整性与可靠性。数据采集覆盖筛选期（筛选前28天至筛选前1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）及安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）三个阶段。访视安排包括：筛选访视（V1）、基线随机访视（V2）、第2周、第4周、第8周、第12周门诊访视（V3至V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，第12周）及末次给药后28天安全性随访访视（V8）。对伦理委员会已批准方案的任何偏离，研究者或其指定人员应给予记录和解释；可能影响受试者安全性和数据完整性的偏离，研究者应及时向申办者报告。为消除对受试者的紧急危害，在未获得伦理委员会批准的情况下偏离或改变方案时，研究者应及时向伦理委员会和申办者报告并说明理由，必要时报告药品监管部门。数据采集的具体系统、录入与核查流程、数据清理计划及源数据核查范围将在数据管理计划中规定。","rationale":"ICH E6/GCP合规要求、赫尔辛基宣言遵循、方案偏离记录与报告要求有公司语料直接支持；研究时期划分（筛选期、治疗期、安全性随访期）和访视策略（V1至V8）有项目研究定义直接支持。数据采集的具体系统（EDC名称）、数据录入与核查流程、数据清理计划、源数据核查比例与范围、数据锁定程序等项目级实施细节缺少来源，需补充数据管理计划。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ca2884a55b3367a7","section_number":"10","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）。","quote_sha256":"dd63df4b3e66ae7ece55e746b97043dbd40d4385a8e4fccb4fbf1d3abe7c762d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"不良事件（AE）与严重不良事件（SAE）发生率（至末次给药后28天）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查异常发生率；症状性低血压发生率","quote_sha256":"eeb150d5b4105ba3f52e8fcb897d472c81b951c8a8aeebfbd7c19078cac79329","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量）","quote_sha256":"179806f8e9e13f1e92db07944174bd1e9ee005466cba901d7f1a2bc206e04cab","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_central_lab"},{"locator":"section:7.3.7 严重不良事件一致性比对|block:1049|chunk:1","quote":"EDC 中 SAE 关键数据点应与安全性数据库进行一致性比对。","quote_sha256":"89137f59a7a4b6b574df06af2472181735de0125de055f6939636b33ffcf7e2c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","span_id":"es_sae_consistency"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","quote":"首次使用研究药物后的所有不良医疗事件作为AE记录。整个研究期间均需记录。","quote_sha256":"f88028a750330bc20bd005d714d3bab0f12453fcb100ac3db69ab4527d8e1eb3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","span_id":"es_ae_recording"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_visit_strategy","es_safety_endpoints","es_central_lab","es_sae_consistency","es_ae_recording"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充数据管理计划或CRF设计文档，明确各访视需采集的数据项","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_crf_01","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","CRF设计文档"],"target":"病例报告表章节中各访视具体采集的数据项清单及CRF模块设计"},{"action":"由医学经理确认本项目AE记录起始时点及记录规则","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_crf_02","missing_source_classes":["项目安全性管理计划"],"target":"本项目是否采用知情同意书至首次用药前不良医疗事件作为病史记录、首次用药后作为AE记录的区分规则"},{"action":"补充数据管理计划中关于CRF形式和版本管理的规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_crf_03","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划"],"target":"病例报告表章节中电子CRF与纸质CRF的选择、CRF版本管理流程"}],"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划（含CRF模块设计、各访视数据项清单、CRF版本管理）","项目级AE记录规则（是否采用知情同意书至首次用药前为病史的区分规则）"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用电子病例报告表采集受试者数据，数据采集范围覆盖筛选期、治疗期及安全性随访期全部访视。病例报告表应记录的数据类别包括：受试者人口学信息与病史、入选与排除标准核查、生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查（含NT-proBNP中心实验室检测）、不良事件与严重不良事件、合并用药、研究药物给药记录与依从性、心功能分级评估及安全性随访期不良事件。首次使用研究药物后出现的所有不良医疗事件均作为不良事件记录，整个研究期间（含安全性随访期）均需持续采集。EDC中记录的严重不良事件关键数据点应与安全性数据库进行一致性比对，确保安全性信息在两个系统间的一致性和完整性。病例报告表的具体模块设计、各访视数据项清单、填写说明及版本管理将在数据管理计划中规定。","rationale":"访视策略（V1至V8）、安全性终点（AE/SAE、生命体征、心电图、实验室检查、症状性低血压）、NT-proBNP中心实验室检测、安全性随访期28天、EDC与安全性数据库一致性比对均有项目研究定义及公司语料支持。AE记录规则（首次用药后为AE、整个研究期间记录）来自公司语料中其他适应症方案，仅作为结构参照，本项目是否采用相同规则需医学经理确认。CRF具体模块设计、各访视数据项清单、电子CRF与纸质CRF选择、CRF版本管理流程等项目级实施细节缺少来源。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_bf6f9fc8a538f1eb","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003062622_10eece6e","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量）","quote_sha256":"179806f8e9e13f1e92db07944174bd1e9ee005466cba901d7f1a2bc206e04cab","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_central_lab"},{"locator":"section:7.3.7 严重不良事件一致性比对|block:1049|chunk:1","quote":"EDC 中 SAE 关键数据点应与安全性数据库进行一致性比对。","quote_sha256":"89137f59a7a4b6b574df06af2472181735de0125de055f6939636b33ffcf7e2c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","span_id":"es_sae_consistency"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）。","quote_sha256":"dd63df4b3e66ae7ece55e746b97043dbd40d4385a8e4fccb4fbf1d3abe7c762d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_central_lab","es_sae_consistency","es_visit_strategy"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充数据管理计划，明确EDC系统、中心实验室平台、安全性数据库的具体名称和版本","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ds_01","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划"],"target":"数据源定义章节中各数据源的具体系统名称、版本及接口规范"},{"action":"补充数据管理计划中数据流向图和质控SOP","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ds_02","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","质控SOP"],"target":"数据源定义章节中各数据源之间的数据流向、传输方式及质控要求"},{"action":"补充数据管理计划或监查计划中关于源数据核查的具体规定","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ds_03","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","监查计划"],"target":"数据源定义章节中源数据核查的范围、比例及核查方法"}],"heading":"数据源的定义","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划（含各数据源定义、数据流向、接口规范、质控要求）","源数据核查计划"],"proposal_text":"本研究的数据来源包括以下类别：电子数据采集系统用于记录各访视的临床观察数据、不良事件、合并用药及研究药物给药信息；中心实验室负责NT-proBNP的定量检测，其检测结果作为主要终点分析的数据来源；申办方安全性数据库用于接收、编码和汇总严重不良事件及可疑非预期严重不良反应信息，EDC中记录的严重不良事件关键数据点应与该安全性数据库进行一致性比对；各研究中心的原始病历、实验室报告、心电图记录及影像学检查报告作为源数据，供监查员和稽查员进行源数据核查。上述各数据源之间的数据流向、接口规范、传输方式及质控要求将在数据管理计划中规定。","rationale":"NT-proBNP由中心实验室定量检测有项目研究定义直接支持；EDC与安全性数据库一致性比对有公司语料支持；访视策略中涉及生命体征、心电图、实验室检查等数据采集有项目研究定义支持。各数据源的具体定义（如EDC系统名称、安全性数据库平台）、数据流向与接口规范、源数据核查范围与比例、各数据源之间的质控要求等项目级实施细节缺少来源，需补充数据管理计划。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_c048cb303b228232","section_number":"10.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"67c90393eb41587e60f2982a860d9d8a58384f98c3bdf31c04d216b71894804e","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_8deea3cca149a555:full-draft:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:74bc4d137995a3fbc08798d185a3087639dacc8b6f5d24c66b6f3176731163ab:91ebc70855cc32ec6cdc935d","text_sha256":"67c90393eb41587e60f2982a860d9d8a58384f98c3bdf31c04d216b71894804e"},{"content_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","text_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2"},{"content_sha256":"12bac064fee816df622f65bd2f3d65dab5b33e902aa7b25ae49db87726080ac4","locator":"section:14 附录 100|block:198|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:20561fabeffbb0","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"20561fabeffbb0","text_sha256":"12bac064fee816df622f65bd2f3d65dab5b33e902aa7b25ae49db87726080ac4"},{"content_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe","locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"04ac0381ef4b49","text_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe"},{"content_sha256":"612b2fb7be765cc4be3a4bab766d6b7f8f8e9bbcaddf49083be695b745bd8699","locator":"section:12.2 方案偏离|block:951|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:256bd99fe3c436","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"256bd99fe3c436","text_sha256":"612b2fb7be765cc4be3a4bab766d6b7f8f8e9bbcaddf49083be695b745bd8699"},{"content_sha256":"89137f59a7a4b6b574df06af2472181735de0125de055f6939636b33ffcf7e2c","locator":"section:7.3.7 严重不良事件一致性比对|block:1049|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df51ff33eb77d6","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"df51ff33eb77d6","text_sha256":"89137f59a7a4b6b574df06af2472181735de0125de055f6939636b33ffcf7e2c"},{"content_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03","locator":"section:8 统计学考虑|block:1056|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"a3cf98aab983c7","text_sha256":"a635fe9c51c78cbc66090c3553c488cd453e807e61608a97e0767740d5088a03"}]}